{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "58b3fac24189ad7a84ae8ee580f91fe67922db80ed25a1e17c3f0fbea0180048", "ja": "（今日は新曲のMV撮影。\n奈緒の様子はどうかな？　見に行ってみよう！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新曲的MV。\n奈绪现在怎么样了呢？去看看吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "f40dbfaa905ca8f2c7c03a99c1a8abd044fd3e32469fa9d6035681da2fa85d2f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nちょっとこっち来て～♪　ふふっ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n过来这边一下嘛～♪ 嘻嘻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1002_p", "source_sha256": "16e64b2b599e47e33357ce1ce049a4255f2422fa1b8942ba3dea16cec0e656fe", "ja": "お疲れさま。えっと……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了。呃……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "509bd8ed83d573e3cd20b712880fe26a3c46cfa56f5b9892a416064fe46203c5", "ja": "うふふっ、{$P$}さ～ん？\n今からたくさんサービスしてあ・げ・る。うふっ♪", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生～？\n接下来我会好好为你服务哦。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "27985008b7c97688237d04624ad6f6ab598ced4b6ab22e6d4882f3892f3cbe9f", "ja": "……奈緒？", "zh": "……奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "09436c8d77e9d505a28586ede4151a9f29a1e78cf12705d7f7b00a04a97a6918", "ja": "怖がらなくていいですよ？\n私に任せてくれたらいいですから！", "zh": "不用害怕哦？\n交给我就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "fcf32d19af5df22cee9d477a230c52ca9de209568dedfebffd0ceaea113dabd8", "ja": "さあリラックス、リラ～ックス……怖くないで～。\nアメちゃんあげますよ～。", "zh": "来，放松，放～松……不可怕的～。\n给你糖哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7b52bc2420904c3fda4e17e33e5ce4e12a1e218bab02188b1f7edddb241dd836", "ja": "奈緒……？", "zh": "奈绪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "f5ee072557b0e7668982e2c649b77b4a426f03b9d47d3b5007560516f0bce65f", "ja": "……。なんでずっと真顔やねーん！\nドキドキしてくれんでも、せめてツッコんでください！", "zh": "……。为什么一直板着张脸啦！\n就算不心跳加速，至少也请吐槽一下嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d2c8fd73b5662f7f4ce146786c52b12d5d89faf27aff030a551cb5c472c9bf3d", "ja": "あ、ああ、ゴメン、急だったから……。\nどうしたんだ？　いきなり。", "zh": "啊，啊啊，对不起，因为太突然了……。\n怎么了？突然这是要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "6b2bdff15d1d3438c0cdee5774eacdc69a6a955aca54b3a58f1b7e3ff4bd860d", "ja": "決まってるやないですか。今日のMV、\nセクシーにやってくれって言われてますよね？", "zh": "这不是明摆着的吗？有人拜托我们今天的MV要拍得性感一点，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "1adb214c15ab47e6b42fbda8cf5d55135fc8d9f93f32bde92f9dd898729c5ae5", "ja": "だから、このみさんや莉緒にも相談して、\n突き詰めてきたんです。私なりのセクシーさを！", "zh": "所以，我还去找了木实姐和莉绪商量，努力钻研到了现在。这就是属于我的性感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1012_p", "source_sha256": "f1b560834b5f5ae95bbf9bf9ffde7091dd502e2db10401d45c42a3abd75652e9", "ja": "（なるほど）", "zh": "（原来如此。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "b6b95e4ff17f306018fa1d885bcb03813137014c58bafad8b1cf2307f7f1363f", "ja": "実際にやってみたら、リアリティが出るん\nちゃうかなーと思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "我原本觉得，要是实际试着做做看的话，\n说不定会更有真实感呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "820728938d25aababe370963e244642da9137caaded0ff5999fe76723b33799f", "ja": "{$P$}さんの\n反応見てると、アカンかったんかな～……？", "zh": "看{$P$}先生的\n反应，难道是不太行吗～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1015_p", "source_sha256": "38672d0b9823eeed674f833222eb82303be1c347ea4fdb606c0d6e7cb948962c", "ja": "いや、そんなことないよ。いきなりで\n戸惑ったけど、結構できてたんじゃないか？", "zh": "不，没有的事。虽然事发突然\n让我有点不知所措，但我觉得表现得挺不错的啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "e7a2682e01660f2431c8ed2ed08c4ef924afdc1b8ac3b254ac2439b4b9b7f6bb", "ja": "えっ！？　ほんまですか……？", "zh": "诶！？真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4994b4251aae2c6445e7b0462450295f537bf5464b6ef4df8e0e5110dfb11e4c", "ja": "ああ、雰囲気は出てたと思うぞ。\n口調はちょっと怪しかったかもだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得氛围还是营造出来了。\n虽然说话的语气可能有点奇怪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "95b7411b23a28417d7c15bdc558241f9e7181224742ba66dd6d0fb6c0851276d", "ja": "やったー！　いや～、ほっとしました。\n最初にテーマを聞いた時、不安やったんです。", "zh": "太好啦！哎呀～，总算松了口气。\n刚听到主题的时候，我还挺不安的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "057429db2739f727c7086f351bdb52a5c3b87017148355633c301be5e62b1727", "ja": "私にセクシーってイメージあんま無いですし、\nちゃんと務まるんかな～思て……。", "zh": "我本来就没什么性感的印象，\n也不知道自己能不能胜任呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9f0d9dc2c4a6e322569863dca38d2e377c47b3612ec0cd1711fcccbfeefd9bd6", "ja": "そうかな？　奈緒はそういう方向性もいけると思うよ。\nだからこそ、この仕事を取ってきたわけだし。", "zh": "是这样吗？我觉得奈绪走这种路线也没问题哦。\n正因为如此，我才接下了这份工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "59b83bed1ea0577e6e6e9a7aca3edcb8a3ae4fa9919044fddbd04b3aa269e886", "ja": "えっ、それって……{$P$}さんが、\n私の事、セクシーって思ってくれてるってこと？", "zh": "诶，那就是说……{$P$}先生觉得我很性感？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4295b4ff99e3dd571d322741abfafa80b76e8f8e47bef7617dc04fa03409cb5a", "ja": "そりゃもちろん。\nこれでも奈緒の事、ちゃんと見てるつもりだよ。", "zh": "那当然了。\n我可是一直都有好好关注奈绪的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "95f1819619e25cb338efad55591a317fefc71a6ee13a47efbb11263fbe61a3c8", "ja": "う……ま、待って待って！　それ以上はアカン！\n今日は私がドキドキさせる方やから……！", "zh": "呜……等、等等！不能再说下去了！\n今天该轮到我让你心跳加速了才对……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "439ce2f7285d4c144610ebf84aec9367134987a7a13a406b64042ed7f14d1fa7", "ja": "本番では負けへん！　もっとセクシーでカッコいい私を\n見せますんで！　覚悟しといてくださいよ！", "zh": "正式演出时我可不会输！我会让你看到更加性感、更加帅气的我！做好心理准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0214_1025_p", "source_sha256": "81216dc4d6b1614d58ef3d5427508baf8da24c57cda1358b2bf43a936bbba024", "ja": "（奈緒、かなりやる気を出してくれているな。\nこっちも覚悟して、見せてもらうとしよう！）", "zh": "（奈绪干劲十足啊。我们也做好心理准备，好好欣赏她的表现吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
